        "Use the first rep as a rehearsal: follow the smooth Technogym guided path and keep a steady rhythm.",
        "Hold the handles or pads, plant your base, and brace the abdomen lightly.",
        "Start without swinging, then curl the handles toward the shoulders and squeeze the biceps fully.",
        "Pause for about one second at the hardest point and confirm tension in the biceps.",
        "Do not let the weight pull you back; lower slowly before the elbows lock so tension stays on the front of the arms.",
        "Between reps, exhale as you curl and inhale as you lower.",
