        "If the forearms and elbow stabilizers fatigue first, soften your grip and restart the motion from the target area.",
        "Think, \"follow the smooth Technogym guided path and keep a steady rhythm\", and keep both sides moving at the same speed.",
        "At the end range, avoid hard joint lockout and leave tension in the muscle.",
